SUMMARY:Water Aerobics Class
LOCATION:Seaside Athletic Club\, Seaside\, Santa Rosa Beach\, FL
DESCRIPTION:Fees apply\n\nThis fun\, low-impact class is designed to improv
 e cardiovascular fitness\, strength\, and flexibility\, all while taking a
 dvantage of the natural resistance of water. Whether you’re a beginner o
 r an experienced swimmer\, water aerobics offers a full-body workout that
 ’s gentle on the joints\, making it ideal for individuals with arthritis
